      "statement": "Solve for $x$: $\\log_{ {{b}} }(x) = {{n}}$",
      "answer": "$x = {{x}}$",
      "solution": "Rewrite in exponential form: $x = {{b}}^{ {{n}} } = {{x}}$.",
